'''Volume 2''' is the second volume of the [[Pokémon Quiz Puzzle Land: Pikachu is a Famous Detective]] manga under the '''{{j|てんとう虫コミックススペシャル}}''' ''Tentōmusi Comics Special'' label. It is composed by [[Hiroshi Takase]] and illustrated by [[Yumiko Sudo]].

